<title>CROATIA: Croatian April currency reserves fall to $4.2 bln.</title>
<headline>Croatian April currency reserves fall to $4.2 bln.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Croatia</p>
<p>issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA CURRENCY RESERVES    APRIL	MARCH	APRIL 96</p>
<p> Total (million USD)	  4,170.2     4,285.1     3,739.1</p>
<p> National Bank of Croatia   2,208.1     2,252.4     1,876.3</p>
<p> Commercial banks	     1,962.1     2,033.7     1,862.8 NOTE</p>
<p>-- The monthly decline in central bank's reserves was put at 2.0 percent while commercial banks' reserves shrank 3.5 percent. -- Zagreb Newsroom, +385 1 455 7075</p>
</text>
